  "source_origin": "Project boot producer 4eb69e5, current native display/sensor profile and bounded slot/private-userdata VRR handoff 84b172c; release-16 native nftables and per-profile root filesystem/panic policy; explicit retained root-selector capability note v1, without VRR activation; release-17 requires the guarded updater, confirms OEM adapter wire 7 before an SDP budget write and uses the current per-CPU workqueue; electrical suspend remains unqualified; candidate native offline userdata expansion with unchanged GPT and filesystem identity, tablet validation pending; v2 explicit four-filesystem userdata policy with built-in XFS/Btrfs and F2FS-only offline growth; new native formats remain untested; candidate native platform-profile QoS and legacy DT compatibility; tablet handoff not qualified; release-18 is based on the accepted release-14 source and pairs the Uke V4L2 THP driver/DT with a separately licensed, versioned and hashed C++ processor; physical contact and suspend validation remain pending; unstable7 pairs mainline19 touch and transport-ready QRTR with the registration-only accepted14 baseline; retain 7.3 RNG/GF128/QCE and notifier compatibility, no physical acceptance; unstable release-8 scopes fixed-board drivers, early modules and DT compilation to Uke while retaining the current touch, QRTR, display and root contracts; source checks do not establish hardware acceptance",
